      "writtenOn": "2024-04-08T18:13:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Small clarification: \n\nThis function is used when Skia imports AHB itself, it\u0027s used for skia builds that are used by android platform. Chrome fills this struct itself, but we will use swizzling with AHB with external formats too later.\n\n`VkAndroidHardwareBufferFormatPropertiesANDROID` actually has `samplerYcbcrConversionComponents` if we want to initialize it here, though it\u0027s a bit awkward with boolean.",
